            "review_title": "Review at Ô Buncha 2A Văn Cao",
            "review_text": "David B\nBruce, Australia1173 contributions\n0\nReal Vietnamese cuisine\nMay 2026 • Couples\nWe were given a demonstration of how to eat Buncha and then set to work on our own. It was excellent. The soup was topped up when it ran low as well as the rice noodles. \n\nThe downside was the stairs. They are very steep and narrow and the dining area is crowded.\nWritten May 18, 2026",
