            "review_title": "Review at Ô Buncha 2A Văn Cao",
            "review_text": "expat326\nSan Francisco, California1869 contributions\n0\nGet a seat on the Balcony for a Great View of old Hanoi\nMar 2026 • Friends\nCame here with two friends for dinner one night. The pork skewers were really good. Also had the fried egg rolls. The place is clean and bright and the service is quick. A highlight is being able to catch a breeze on the upstairs balcony and watch the street scene below. A step about the usual hawker stalls in old Hanoi.\nInsider tip:\nGo upstairs to the balcony for the best seats.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 17, 2026",
